  "boundary_definition": "Boundary at position i (i > 0) when tag[i] differs from tag[i-1].",
  "matching_policy": "Exact position equality only (tolerance 0). A one-token shift is one false positive plus one false negative. Tolerant matching requires a separate one-to-one matching specification.",
